{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38633","headline":"方响歌 · 李沇","name":"方响歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"敲金扣石声相凌，遥空冷静天正澄。\n宝缾下井辘轳急，小娃弄索伤清冰。\n穿丝透管音未歇，回风绕指惊泉咽。\n季伦怒击珊瑚摧，灵芸整鬓步摇折。\n十六叶中侵素光，寒玲震月杂佩璫。\n云和不觉罢余怨，莲峰一夜啼琴姜。\n急节写商商恨促，秦愁越调逡巡足。\n梦入仙楼戛残曲，飞霜棱棱上秋玉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李沇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38633.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38633","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}